author=BitPerfect-DAC contributors
description=Pins the AudioFlinger USB mixer (hifi_playback) to one rate instead of the DAC maximum (384 kHz) and can follow the track rate. Tools: bpstatus, bpcheck, bprate, bpverify, bpdiag, bpdump, bpoffload. EXPERIMENTAL.
